      "**Reverse Characteristics & Depletion Generation Current (Slides 347\u2013353):** Ideal vs. non-ideal reverse current components, thermal generation in the space-charge region ($I_{gen} \\propto \\sqrt{V_R}$), and demarcation of the three reverse bias operating regions.",
      "**Junction Breakdown Mechanics: Zener vs. Avalanche (Slides 354\u2013359):** Quantum mechanical band-to-band tunneling vs. impact ionization, critical breakdown fields, temperature coefficients ($dV_{BR}/dT$), zero-tempco crossover, and critical field calculations.",
