      "**Depletion Recombination & Multi-Layer Built-in Potentials (Slides 367\u2013374):** Shockley-Read-Hall (SRH) recombination peak at the metallurgical junction, multi-layer built-in potential cancellation theorem, isotype junctions, and the open-circuit voltmeter paradox.",
      "**BJT Physics, Structural Asymmetries & Fabrication (Slides 375\u2013381):** Failure of back-to-back discrete diodes, base transit condition ($W_B \\ll L_B$), carrier mobility advantage of NPN, structural doping/width hierarchies ($N_E \\gg N_B > N_C$, $W_C > W_E > W_B$), and planar monolithic fabrication.",
