      "Real vs. Ideal MOSCap: Work function difference $\\phi_{ms} = \\Phi_m - \\Phi_s$, oxide fixed charge $Q_{ox}$, definition of Ideal MOSCap ($\\phi_{ms} = 0, Q_{ox} = 0 \\implies V_{FB} = 0$).",
