     "text": "This academic monograph constitutes an exhaustive, publication-grade audit of **Chalkboard Lecture Slides 586 through 714** of Electronic Devices & Circuits (EDC) from the PrepFusion Titans Batch. This terminal master module spans the full operational physics of Field-Effect Transistors and photonic solid-state devices: DC load lines, operating region verification, small-signal transconductance ($g_m, g_{mb}$), channel-length modulation ($\\lambda$), output resistance ($r_o$), subthreshold weak inversion conduction, Subthreshold Swing ($S$), short-channel effects (velocity saturation, mobility degradation, DIBL, hot-carrier degradation), optical absorption laws, photodiode responsivity and quantum efficiency, solar cell fourth-quadrant power conversion, light-emitting diodes (LEDs), and metal-semiconductor Schottky vs Ohmic contacts."
